  "details": "We're working on various improvements to VRChat's implementation of TextMeshPro.  This will complete a variety of other Canny requests. 🥳\n\nWe're adding new wrapper components to the Worlds SDK.\n\n- TextMeshProUGUI\n\n- TextMeshPro\n\n- TMP Dropdown\n\n- TMP InputField\n\nFor security reasons, wrappers are required to access TMP components (except TextMeshProUGUI, which did not require a wrapper before).",
